WRITE_SENSOR_DETECT
Title Import Driver Path <Driver Model>
CATEGORY Driver Model 
DATASET_TITLE Import Driver Path
#RingCtrl8 1
NUM_CACHED_RUNS 1
#RingCtrl9 

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the ability to import a path preview for the CarSim Driver model.
#
#First, VS Commands are used to calculate 10 preview points from the existing path. In practice, the 10 imported points will likely come from software other than CarSim. Second, these 10 preview points are imported for use by both the steering controller and the speed controller.
#
#The overlaid run (blue car) shows the CarSim Driver Model querying the path directly.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

